  "description": "Community (free) edition of sgcGrid .NET: the real-time grid core, change flashing, format rules, sort, filter, virtual mode, headless renderer and the WinForms, WPF and Avalonia views, with no functional limits. Free for both commercial and non-commercial use by small teams (individuals and organizations under EUR 1M annual gross revenue and no more than 5 developers); organizations at or above either threshold need a Commercial licence. In-place editing and the sgcWebSockets and sgcHTML bridges are not included in the Community edition. https://www.esegece.com",
